02:09:24.590 --> 02:09:25.889
these three questions.

02:09:25.889 --> 02:09:32.260
The first question, what is the wake? What
is it? What is this thing that you see? And

02:09:32.260 --> 02:09:41.190
the answer, the wake is the trail that is
left behind. That's what it is. Nothing more,

02:09:41.190 --> 02:09:45.630
nothing less. It's the trail that is left
behind. Second question to ask yourself in

02:09:45.630 --> 02:09:49.380
this little metaphor, what's driving the boat?

02:09:49.380 --> 02:09:56.500
What's making this thing go in this direction?
The answer, the present moment, energy. that's

02:09:56.500 --> 02:10:02.650
being generated by the engine and nothing
more. That's the only thing that's making

02:10:02.650 --> 02:10:08.670
the boat go in this direction and in this
little scene. This means it's the present

02:10:08.670 --> 02:10:15.940
moment, thoughts that I have and how I am
using them that is making my life go in this

02:10:15.940 --> 02:10:16.940
direction.

02:10:16.940 --> 02:10:21.400
And nothing more. Because the third question
is the most important and powerful question,

02:10:21.400 --> 02:10:24.300
and I've ever, ever since I heard it, I've
always thought about this. Whenever I have

02:10:24.300 --> 02:10:30.050
a tendency to look back here and blame something,

02:10:30.050 --> 02:10:39.780
is it possible for the wake to drive the boat?
That is, can a trail that is left behind,

02:10:39.780 --> 02:10:46.380
make a boat, go in this direction? And of
course the answer to that is no. It can't.

02:10:46.380 --> 02:10:51.320
It's just a trail that is left behind. And
in that trail, there are an enormous number

02:10:51.320 --> 02:10:55.640
of things and every one of us has a wake and
we have a whole lot of stuff in it.

02:10:55.640 --> 02:11:03.650
And one of the problems that we have is that
we have a tendency to look at the wake and

02:11:03.650 --> 02:11:08.510
all of the stuff that's in it to explain why
it is my life isn't working the way I would

02:11:08.510 --> 02:11:16.570
like it to work. So that, um, you can take
a look at the experiences of your life. I

02:11:16.570 --> 02:11:21.500
look at the experiences of my life and the
experiences of my life.

02:11:21.500 --> 02:11:27.670
I spent some years in a, a series of foster
homes. People have said to me, Ugh, living

02:11:27.670 --> 02:11:33.510
in a foster home, that must have been terrible.
I said, no, it wasn't terrible at all. When

02:11:33.510 --> 02:11:38.480
you're six years old, you don't wake up every
day and say, oh my God, I'm living in a foster

02:11:38.480 --> 02:11:41.840
home. Isn't this awful? Poor me? How come
me and nobody else?

02:11:41.840 --> 02:11:47.739
You don't do that. You don't do that till
you. And when you're 40 and your life isn't

02:11:47.739 --> 02:11:52.570
working and you're bankrupt and you're a drug
addict and, and, and you're falling, your

02:11:52.570 --> 02:11:57.130
relationships are all falling apart and your
family's leaving you, and you say, why is

02:11:57.130 --> 02:11:59.920
this happening to you? You said, what do you
expect from me?

02:11:59.920 --> 02:12:04.659
I had to live in a foster home. My mother
liked my sister better. We were to this, we

02:12:04.659 --> 02:12:09.210
were to. And so it's like we take a look at
all of these things in our way. And I'm not

02:12:09.210 --> 02:12:15.540
saying here that you shouldn't be in touch
with your past and all of the things that

02:12:15.540 --> 02:12:20.440
are back there, but to use it as excuses for
why you can't get where you'd like to get

02:12:20.440 --> 02:12:24.969
today is something that you, if you do, that
you will never get to.

02:12:24.969 --> 02:12:29.260
This place that I'm talking about in this
program, which is this place that I call higher

02:12:29.260 --> 02:12:34.930
awareness, way beyond ordinary human awareness,
one of the most powerful lessons that you

02:12:34.930 --> 02:12:41.960
can ever learn. I had to learn as a young
man. My own father was a man who, uh, walked

02:12:41.960 --> 02:12:46.920
away. He left, he left home when I was just
a baby.

02:12:46.920 --> 02:12:55.170
Left my mother who's sitting right here, 107
years old. Is that what you, no, you're not

02:12:55.170 --> 02:13:03.340
107 , 82 years old Owen. And with three little
boys and all I had ever heard when he walked

02:13:03.340 --> 02:13:08.380
out about this person that my older brothers
told me about. And that, uh, when my mother

02:13:08.380 --> 02:13:12.780
got her family back together again when I
was nine years old and, and did all that she

02:13:12.780 --> 02:13:19.050
could to, uh, to make a family again with
all the hardships, this was a man who never

02:13:19.050 --> 02:13:27.480
made a phone call, who never sent a penny,
who spent some time in prison who was an alcoholic,

02:13:27.480 --> 02:13:33.650
who died of cirrhosis of the liver at the
age of 49, and was buried in a popper's grave

02:13:33.650 --> 02:13:34.820
in Biloxi, Mississippi.

02:13:34.820 --> 02:13:42.070
And it wasn't until I went to his grave and
was able to stand there. And I used to dream

02:13:42.070 --> 02:13:46.750
about this man and have this more enormous
hatred for this person whom I had never seen,

02:13:46.750 --> 02:13:52.070
just based upon what he had done to my own
mother and to my brothers and so on, and all

02:13:52.070 --> 02:13:55.130
of the stories that I had heard and all the
research that I had done.

02:13:55.130 --> 02:14:00.070
And I ended up at his grave, 10 years after
he had died, when I finally found out that

02:14:00.070 --> 02:14:11.710
he was dead. It was on the 27th of August.
It was 1974. And what I did transformed my

02:14:11.710 --> 02:14:18.440
life. What I did is I believe I was sent there
by God or whatever you want to call that divine

02:14:18.440 --> 02:14:22.570
spirit, the divine presence. And my life at
that time wasn't working.

02:14:22.570 --> 02:14:25.849
I was overweight. My relationships weren't
working, my writing wasn't working. There

02:14:25.849 --> 02:14:31.460
were a lot of things that weren't going well
for me in my life at that time. Not badly,

02:14:31.460 --> 02:14:36.420
but they weren't going at the level that I
knew I was capable of getting to because I

02:14:36.420 --> 02:14:40.159
was filled with this hatred, this anger, this
bitterness.

02:14:40.159 --> 02:14:46.760
And so what I did is I stood there on his
grave on this little marker in the ground,

02:14:46.760 --> 02:14:54.760
and I said, from now on, I send you love.
I forgive you. Mark Twain said that forgiveness

02:14:54.760 --> 02:15:03.840
is the fragrance that the violet sheds on
the heel that has crushed it. And once I let

02:15:03.840 --> 02:15:10.050
go of that anger and that hatred and all of
my attachment to the bonding that I had done

02:15:10.050 --> 02:15:15.880
with these wounds and let go of that and cleared
that out of my life, my writing began to take

02:15:15.880 --> 02:15:17.800
place at a much higher level.

02:15:17.800 --> 02:15:22.320
In fact, I wrote erroneous zones in very,
very short time. After that, I began to get

02:15:22.320 --> 02:15:27.271
myself back in shape. I began to eat better.
I began exercising, keeping my uh, got my

02:15:27.271 --> 02:15:32.400
weight down and the people that were supposed
to come into my life, like my beautiful wife

02:15:32.400 --> 02:15:36.440
who sits here with me this evening, and all
of our children, some of whom are here this

02:15:36.440 --> 02:15:40.350
evening,

02:15:40.350 --> 02:15:49.139
All of it was allowed to flow when I released
that, that energy of negativity and blame

02:15:49.139 --> 02:15:57.300
and hatred, they say that you never die from
a snake bite. It isn't the bite, and you can't

02:15:57.300 --> 02:16:02.820
be un bitten. It's in the wake. What kills
you is the venom that continues to pour through

02:16:02.820 --> 02:16:06.170
you long after the bite has taken place.

02:16:06.170 --> 02:16:11.750
And that's something we have control over
and we can't change. And I'd like to suggest

02:16:11.750 --> 02:16:16.961
that what happens is that many of us bond
ourselves to these wounds of our past. If

02:16:16.961 --> 02:16:27.860
I were to cut my hand, just cut it and watch
it, my nature says, flows up the wound, and

02:16:27.860 --> 02:16:31.840
I just have to watch it. And there's no doctor
out there, there's no medicine out there that's

02:16:31.840 --> 02:16:33.670
gonna heal that wound.

02:16:33.670 --> 02:16:37.090
There's something, there's a healing stream
that I am connected to that will allow that

02:16:37.090 --> 02:16:41.800
wound to heal. So my nature says, close up
the wounds. Don't bond to them. Don't hang

02:16:41.800 --> 02:16:46.550
on to them, close 'em up. But supposing I
say to myself, oh no, you don't. There's no

02:16:46.550 --> 02:16:51.990
way I'm gonna let you close up. . You see
if I can keep you open and I can go to you

02:16:51.990 --> 02:16:52.990
and say, look at this.

02:16:52.990 --> 02:16:57.670
Say what happened? Well, look at this cut.
I've got, oh, you poor thing. Look at that.

02:16:57.670 --> 02:17:01.969
It seems to be getting worse. It's getting
infected. . Isn't that terrible? And if you

02:17:01.969 --> 02:17:06.740
practice this kind of a mentality when your
nature says close up the wound, but you keep

02:17:06.740 --> 02:17:12.460
it open before long, you lose your hand . And
after that, you'll lose your arm and the whole

02:17:12.460 --> 02:17:15.760
organism will be destroyed if you don't let
your nature take over.

02:17:15.760 --> 02:17:21.800
And your nature also says, close up the wounds
of your past. Close them up. And oftentimes

02:17:21.800 --> 02:17:29.620
we ignore our nature. I had a great teacher
that came into my life through his writing.

02:17:29.620 --> 02:17:37.889
His name was Nisar Gata. Maharaj lived in
India up until the mid 1980s. And he wrote

02:17:37.889 --> 02:17:42.500
something called I Am that, which was very
powerful and influential in my life.

02:17:42.500 --> 02:17:47.090
And one of the things that he talked about
when he was asked the question, what's the

02:17:47.090 --> 02:17:54.130
difference between say a saint or a highly
functioning human being, a spiritual master,

02:17:54.130 --> 02:18:00.899
a spiritual teacher, and the rest of us, is
that they have unconditional love in them

02:18:00.899 --> 02:18:07.069
and you don't. Or we don't. And he said, no.
He said, saints have unconditional love in

02:18:07.069 --> 02:18:08.940
them and so do you.

02:18:08.940 --> 02:18:17.450
He said, the difference between ordinary human
awareness and higher awareness people is that

02:18:17.450 --> 02:18:24.500
they have nothing else inside of them. That's
all they have. And it's almost like we have

02:18:24.500 --> 02:18:29.769
to learn how to get that in ourselves to be
able to, well, I always like to use a metaphor

02:18:29.769 --> 02:18:32.120
of an orange. I love the orange.

02:18:32.120 --> 02:18:40.090
Perhaps living in Florida is why. But an orange
is a simple metaphor. You take this orange

02:18:40.090 --> 02:18:47.340
and you squeeze it as hard as you can squeeze
it, and you ask yourself what will come out

02:18:47.340 --> 02:18:53.719
and what comes out When you squeeze an orange,
orange juice, never, no matter how many times

02:18:53.719 --> 02:18:55.859
you squeeze it, will apple juice come out.

02:18:55.859 --> 02:18:59.899
There's no mistakes. You'll never get grapefruit
juice out of this thing ever. The only thing

02:18:59.899 --> 02:19:03.880
you'll ever get out of it is orange juice.
And the next question is, why? Why wouldn't

02:19:03.880 --> 02:19:07.960
you squeeze an orange as hard as you can squeeze
it? Does orange juice come out? And I asked

02:19:07.960 --> 02:19:11.050
that question up in Toronto one time, this
little girl sitting right in the front row,

02:19:11.050 --> 02:19:13.740
she said, that's dumb

02:19:13.740 --> 02:19:18.569
It's a, she said, that's what's inside. It
has to come out. I said, well, that's the

02:19:18.569 --> 02:19:23.710
answer. You are really smart. And she's smiled
and she thought that was great. But that's

02:19:23.710 --> 02:19:27.290
the truth. The reason that orange juice comes
out when you squeezes is because that's what's

02:19:27.290 --> 02:19:32.300
inside. Now. You extend the metaphor and someone
squeezes you.

02:19:32.300 --> 02:19:35.929
That is someone says something about you that
you don't like. Someone behaves towards you

02:19:35.929 --> 02:19:40.670
in a way that you find offensive. Somebody
does something or says something to you that

02:19:40.670 --> 02:19:49.290
you feel hurt by and out of you comes anger,
hatred, bitterness, tension, fear, anxiety,

02:19:49.290 --> 02:19:58.170
stress, and immediately you say, the reason
that comes out of me is because of how he

02:19:58.170 --> 02:20:01.170
said it or the way that she said that, or
because they did that.

02:20:01.170 --> 02:20:09.020
But the truth is, the reality is that what
comes out is what's inside. And if you don't

02:20:09.020 --> 02:20:15.020
like what's inside, you can change it. Now,
if you ask me, how does orange juice get inside

02:20:15.020 --> 02:20:22.130
of an orange? I would say, I don't know. I
can't figure it out. That's a mystery to me.

02:20:22.130 --> 02:20:26.670
I just enjoy the oranges of my life and give
God the credit for that.

02:20:26.670 --> 02:20:31.760
A lot of people think that other things make
them the way they are. They will blame their

02:20:31.760 --> 02:20:36.510
past. They'll blame their parents. They'll
blame the economy. They'll blame the Aya Toola.

02:20:36.510 --> 02:20:40.020
They'll blame somebody for things that are
going wrong in their life. And one of the

02:20:40.020 --> 02:20:44.510
favorite things that we have to blame for
why I'm upset at a particular moment is something

02:20:44.510 --> 02:20:46.580
called traffic.

02:20:46.580 --> 02:20:50.970
Traffic made me upset, and I've always reminded
myself when I'm in a jam or when I'm on the

02:20:50.970 --> 02:20:55.670
freeway and I'm trying to get someplace, the
traffic doesn't care. That you have within

02:20:55.670 --> 02:21:01.960
you the opportunity in this moment to really
work on these things that are perhaps debilitating

02:21:01.960 --> 02:21:07.050
or or creating anxiety or stress in your life,
that these are tests, these are opportunities

02:21:07.050 --> 02:21:08.170
for you.

02:21:08.170 --> 02:21:14.380
Traffic doesn't care. Your anger is your choice,
and you can always choose to be the be happy,

02:21:14.380 --> 02:21:20.120
angry, depressed, miserable, upset, or you
can choose to be fulfilled and do something

02:21:20.120 --> 02:21:25.260
positive. In this moment, it's always up to
you. I'd like to give you what I think of

02:21:25.260 --> 02:21:30.340
as the great spiritual teachings of many various.

02:21:30.340 --> 02:21:36.010
Persuasions. There's a story that summarizes
it. It's the story of what I call the four

02:21:36.010 --> 02:21:44.540
philanthropists in a village. The conquerors
had come through and they had taken all of

02:21:44.540 --> 02:21:49.660
the men, or many of the men who were warriors
at the time, and they had placed them into

02:21:49.660 --> 02:21:53.130
this prisoner of war camp right in the village.

02:21:53.130 --> 02:21:58.910
And many of the villagers knew that their
compatriots were imprisoned. And the first

02:21:58.910 --> 02:22:07.330
philanthropist was a person who had great
wealth, and he went to the people who had

02:22:07.330 --> 02:22:13.930
the prison and were in charge of it. And he
said to them, I understand the men are not

02:22:13.930 --> 02:22:19.550
able to have fresh water and cold water. I
would like to donate all of my earnings and

02:22:19.550 --> 02:22:24.760
everything that I have to purifying the water
for them and making sure that all of them

02:22:24.760 --> 02:22:27.000
will not be sick.

02:22:27.000 --> 02:22:30.460
And he was granted that, and he felt like
he had fulfilled his destiny, that he had

02:22:30.460 --> 02:22:37.550
done what he was here for. The second philanthropist
discovered that the men were sleeping on rocks

02:22:37.550 --> 02:22:40.670
and that they were cold at night. They didn't
have blankets. And he took all of his funds

02:22:40.670 --> 02:22:45.460
and he said to them, I would like to provide
bedding and blankets for the people so that

02:22:45.460 --> 02:22:48.399
they will be comfortable when they sleep at
night.

02:22:48.399 --> 02:22:52.540
And he was granted that, right? And he donated
his money for this purpose. And again, he

02:22:52.540 --> 02:22:58.670
felt that he was fulfilling his destiny. The
third philanthropist discovered that the food

02:22:58.670 --> 02:23:06.080
that they were eating was inadequate. That
they were just given, uh, beans and, and uh,

02:23:06.080 --> 02:23:11.899
and water and some bread. And so he said,
I own a farm and I'd like to grow all of my

02:23:11.899 --> 02:23:15.790
food, and I'd like to take this food to all
of these prisoners.

02:23:15.790 --> 02:23:19.910
And he was granted that, right? And all three
of these great philanthropists in the village

02:23:19.910 --> 02:23:26.490
felt that they had really completed their
mission for why they were here. But the fourth

02:23:26.490 --> 02:23:33.000
philanthropist was a saint. He was living
not at ordinary human awareness, but at higher

02:23:33.000 --> 02:23:40.520
consciousness levels. And he went and he found
out where the keys were, and he went to the

02:23:40.520 --> 02:23:46.920
prison at night and he released all of the
prisoners.

02:23:46.920 --> 02:23:52.700
And this little metaphorical story really
tells us that when we are living at ordinary

02:23:52.700 --> 02:23:56.990
human awareness, there's nothing wrong with
those who are out there who can help us to

02:23:56.990 --> 02:24:03.120
suffer in comfort. All right? And many of
us have learned to do that and accept that

02:24:03.120 --> 02:24:07.610
and say, all right, as long as I'm comfortable,
even if I'm suffering, it's okay.

02:24:07.610 --> 02:24:14.901
But there are those who have keys, and those
keys can open the prisons. One of the great

02:24:14.901 --> 02:24:22.630
teachers in my life was Carlos Castaneda and
Castaneda talked about his teacher who was,

02:24:22.630 --> 02:24:30.330
what they call inaugural a, an a Native American
term that, uh, refers to, uh, all that is

02:24:30.330 --> 02:24:41.950
knowable. And he, his teacher told him that
your life is like being born into a, uh, a

02:24:41.950 --> 02:24:48.319
room, a mansion, if you will, that has a thousand
rooms, but you're born into one room.

02:24:48.319 --> 02:24:53.910
And this one room is called daily human awareness.
And the only way you can get in is through

02:24:53.910 --> 02:25:02.900
conception and birth you're in. And the only
way you can get out we are taught is to die.

02:25:02.900 --> 02:25:10.080
So we spend our lives in this mansion in one
room. Even those, there's 999 other rooms.

02:25:10.080 --> 02:25:13.130
We don't know how to get out into those rooms
unless we die.

02:25:13.130 --> 02:25:20.520
So we wait to die. And what his teacher told
him is, I can teach you how to get out of

02:25:20.520 --> 02:25:30.380
the room of daily awareness and into the other
999 rooms. And if you stay with me and learn

02:25:30.380 --> 02:25:37.460
all that, I have to give you, I can teach
you how to get out of the house altogether

02:25:37.460 --> 02:25:42.761
without having to die. And what we have to
do in order to get to that place where we

02:25:42.761 --> 02:25:49.490
can take the keys and unlock the self-imposed
prisons or the prisons that we have given

02:25:49.490 --> 02:25:55.090
ourselves on the basis of what we have come
to believe is our limitations.

02:25:55.090 --> 02:26:00.370
What we can and can't do, we have to let go
of that. And I call it rewriting our agreement

02:26:00.370 --> 02:26:05.690
with reality. We literally have to make a,
a whole new contract with what it is that

02:26:05.690 --> 02:26:12.380
I perceive to be what is possible for me.
And in order to do that, we have to shift

02:26:12.380 --> 02:26:17.359
out of the things that we have come to believe
in.

02:26:17.359 --> 02:26:23.550
And everything that you came to this program
watching tonight, that you believe in was

02:26:23.550 --> 02:26:30.580
handed to you by someone else outside of you,
was handed to you by the experiences or testimony

02:26:30.580 --> 02:26:38.220
of someone in the past. And because it comes
from outside of you, there is still an element

02:26:38.220 --> 02:26:45.590
of doubt. And this element of doubt isn't
bad, but it keeps you from reaching higher

02:26:45.590 --> 02:26:48.950
levels because what you think about is what
expands.

02:26:48.950 --> 02:26:54.390
And if you're thinking doubt, then doubt is
what expands. William Blake said, if the sun

02:26:54.390 --> 02:27:02.130
and moon should ever doubt, they would immediately
go out. So how do we get past what we believe

02:27:02.130 --> 02:27:07.160
in or what has been handed to us and still
honor it and be grateful for all of the teachers

02:27:07.160 --> 02:27:10.120
and all of the people who have come before
us?

02:27:10.120 --> 02:27:15.220
So what we have to learn to do is let go of
that tribal consciousness and shift to what

02:27:15.220 --> 02:27:21.790
I call unknowing. Now, there's a big difference
between what you believe and what you know.

02:27:21.790 --> 02:27:27.381
Everything that you know is something that
you have made conscious contact with. Conscious

02:27:27.381 --> 02:27:31.170
contact. So there's nobody out there watching.

02:27:31.170 --> 02:27:36.530
There's nobody in this world who knows how
to swim, who learned it by somebody else.

02:27:36.530 --> 02:27:43.630
Telling them that you can swim or by watching
Mark Spitz go through the water , or by, uh,

02:27:43.630 --> 02:27:49.430
observing other people doing it. You may remove
some of the doubt, but you will never know

02:27:49.430 --> 02:27:55.569
how to swim until you get in the water and
bleb around a few times and then do it.

02:27:55.569 --> 02:27:59.069
And then you'll have a knowing. And that knowing
is something that you'll never lose. Just

02:27:59.069 --> 02:28:05.380
like riding a bicycle or dancing the Macarena
or making a, a, a lemon meringue pie or anything

02:28:05.380 --> 02:28:11.240
that you know how to do, it's because you've
made conscious contact. And I'd like to suggest

02:28:11.240 --> 02:28:18.510
